<title>PORTUGAL: No 364-day bills placed at auction.</title>
<headline>No 364-day bills placed at auction.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Institute of Management of Public Credit (IGCP) said no 364-day bills were placed at today's auction.  </p>
<p>The average weighted interest rate at the previous auction was 5.2389 percent.</p>
</text>
